{"artist": "Frank Ocean", "streams": null, "best_position": null}]}, "jazz": {"genre": "jazz", "country_code": "eg", "country_name": "Egypt", "summary": "Jazz is a musical art form which originated around the beginning of the 20th century in Black communities in the Southern United States from a confluence of African and European music traditions. The style's West African pedigree is evident in its use of blue notes, call-and-response, improvisation, polyrhythms, syncopation, and the swung note of ragtime.\n\nFrom its early development until the present, jazz has also incorporated music from 19th and 20th century American popular music, which is based on European music traditions.", "url": null, "artists": [{"artist": "Kendrick Lamar", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Lady Gaga", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Laufey", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Sade", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Steve Lacy", "streams": null, "best_position": null}]}, "pop": {"genre": "pop", "country_code": "eg", "country_name": "Egypt", "summary": "Pop music is a broad-term for many different types of music: The term is flexible, and the music labeled \"pop\" changes frequently. It usually refers to popular, appealing and mostly mainstream music with emphasis on catchy melodies and an accessible style, with songs that tend to have a short to medium length. Some subgenres may include synthpop, electropop, bubblegum, sophisti-pop, hyperpop and many others.", "url": null, "artists": [{"artist": "Ramy Sabry", "streams": 556432, "best_position": 4}, {"artist": "TUL8TE", "streams": 445945, "best_position": 3}, {"artist": "Amr Diab", "streams": 117394, "best_position": 31}, {"artist": "Mond", "streams": 22618, "best_position": 100}, {"artist": "A$AP Rocky", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "AD\u00c9LA", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Arctic Monkeys", "streams": null, "best_